# CarpetBeater's unattended part, twice a month: refresh, the code tests,
# BkoTest2All, BackShot1, BackShot2Alpine (the suite is the user's; auto-memory
# "CarpetBeater", docs/design/batch.md §3.3).  Step 1 (the refresh) and the
# ThinkPad block (step 5) stay manual: decisions 8 and 9.
set round rel6
set hosts chopin,cinqcent,copland,cage
set retry 1

manual  step 1: vm-update round (t2 GuestTest2 update, lid open), then rebuild the rescue images
t2      GateTest2All rel6       why="step 2: code tests, the fork suites"
t2      SweepTest2 rel6         why="step 3: BkoTest2All, part 1"
t2      ImgTest2All release     why="step 3: BkoTest2All, part 2"
bs2     BackShot2Alpine 200     why="step 4"
manual  step 5: the ThinkPad block, BackShot1 then BackShot2Alpine's tier 3 cases
